305
00:10:27,496 --> 00:10:28,655
I asked Zhang Tao.

306
00:10:28,976 --> 00:10:30,136
He said tonight's dinner

307
00:10:30,256 --> 00:10:31,175
is quite important.

308
00:10:32,055 --> 00:10:33,175
Mr. Wu controls most of

309
00:10:33,175 --> 00:10:34,175
