310
00:10:34,216 --> 00:10:35,175
nationwide.

311
00:10:35,535 --> 00:10:36,376
When he hosts,

312
00:10:36,616 --> 00:10:37,976
almost nobody turns him down.

313
00:10:38,415 --> 00:10:38,775
Ready.

314
00:10:44,295 --> 00:10:44,736
Looks good.

315
00:10:51,456 --> 00:10:52,136
