746
00:26:38,815 --> 00:26:39,176
Who?

747
00:26:42,615 --> 00:26:43,335
Him?

748
00:26:43,736 --> 00:26:44,535
We were colleagues,

749
00:26:45,016 --> 00:26:45,615
but

750
00:26:45,815 --> 00:26:47,295
